    "jf_image_content_cta_36jhHR": {
      "type": "jf-image-content-cta",
      "name": "JF Image Content CTA",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_22897.png",
        "eyebrow": "COUTURE WEDDING DRESSES MELBOURNE",
        "heading_line_one": "Sculpting a Shared Vision in the Julie Sufi Atelier",
        "heading_line_two": "",
        "description": "<p>Since 2010, Julie Sufi has been the visionary behind couture wedding dresses for the discerning Melbourne bride. Your journey begins not with a sales consultant but with a private dialogue with our founder and head designer, Julie. Together, we explore the nuances of your vision, the touch of the fabric, and the architecture of your silhouette. </p><p>The result is a presence that brides describe as effortless, elegant, and entirely personal.</p><p><strong>Melbourne Couture: The Individual Form</strong><br/><br/><strong>Beyond the Ready-to-Wear:</strong> We embrace the freedom of bespoke design, creating wedding gowns that mirror the soul and silhouette of the bride.</p><p><strong>Meticulously Sculpted:</strong> Every piece is a study in precision, custom-tailored to your exact measurements for a flawless, architectural fit.</p><p>From the initial charcoal sketch to the final fitting, your journey is guided by high-fashion expertise recognized by <em>Vogue, Elle,</em> and <em>Harper’s Bazaar</em>.<br/><br/><strong>A Legacy Realized: Est. 2010</strong><br/></p><ul><li><strong>The Working Atelier:</strong> Our studio is a sanctuary of quiet mastery, where your vision is transformed into a physical reality that is authentically, singularly yours.</li><li><strong>Years of Artistry:</strong> With over 15 years of couture heritage and 5,000+ brides served, we bring a deep, seasoned expertise to every deliberate stitch.</li></ul><p>Julie Sufi’s Melbourne boutique is a destination for brides who believe their gown should be as extraordinary as their day.</p>",
        "show_cta_box": true,
        "cta_eyebrow": "Gowns from",
